name: sim.broadcastMsg
description: Broadcasts a message to all scripts, except for the emitting script. Messages are received synchronously via the sysCall_msg callback function
luaSynopsis: sim.broadcastMsg(dict message, int options = 0)
pythonSynopsis: sim.broadcastMsg(map message, int options = 0)
inputs:
1. message: message to broadcast. Best is to use following skeleton message: message = {'id': 'msgIdentifyingString', 'data': [...]}
2. options: not used, keep at 0
outputs:
